%F A399333 A(n, n) = P(n), the noncomposite numbers A008578.
%F A399333 A(n, k) = Sum_{m=0..d} binomial(d, m) * s^(d - m) * P(p + m), where d = abs(n - k), p = min(n, k), s = 1 if k <= n, otherwise -1.
